abstract: "Autonomous coding agents increasingly execute long-horizon loops of generation, verification, and repair. This paper argues that specification gaming is a fourth failure axis — orthogonal to context rot, error compounding, and goal drift at the level of defense mechanism — and proposes the Process/Outcome split plus verification-source decoupling as the engineering discipline; SolidForge (this repository) is its DeepSeek Harness-native reference implementation."
keywords:
  - specification gaming
  - autonomous coding agents
  - verification-source decoupling
  - loop engineering
  - AI safety
